# ACMedia's pinned sources (designs/ACMEDIA-DESIGN-20261110.md, section 4).
# One line each: name, file, sha256, url. fetch.sh downloads into ACM_CACHE and
# refuses any file whose sha256 differs. A new version is a new line here and a
# PR; nothing is fetched by name alone.
#
# ffmpeg      LGPL 2.1+ (we never configure --enable-gpl/version3/nonfree);
#             the tarball's GPG signature is also checked (key FCF986EA15E6E293A5644F10B4322F04D67658D8)
# ffmpeg-rpi  Raspberry Pi's patch for 7.1.5 (RPi-Distro/ffmpeg pios/trixie at 2fe08f3):
#             the V4L2 request HEVC hwaccel, SAND frames, DRM PRIME; MIT/BSD/LGPL files
# dav1d       BSD-2-Clause (AV1)
# libopenmpt  BSD-3-Clause (tracker modules)
# libva       MIT; headers only (x86-64), linked against the host's libva.so.2
# libudev.h   LGPL 2.1+ (systemd v259); the header only, for hosts without libudev-dev,
#             linked against the host's libudev.so.1 (the Pi patch's device scan needs it)
